Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nproblems, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon,\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forward then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.72,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I want to take you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.86,0:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To let's head for it\Nthen, but after the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we already know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.90,0:02:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Judge has taken on\Nthat pirate Sanji Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I heard he already beat up Master\NYoji. What kind of monster is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That lout was still refusing the marriage,\Nso I tried to step in on Father's behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then this happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's such an arrogant asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears we'll need to use a tool\Nmore powerful than the hammer, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting to press.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still a second. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a reject, a\Ndisappointment, and a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.78,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Master Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you're prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.78,0:03:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sanji had a hefty\Nbounty on his head after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a shame to kick your father, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess the guy who started\Nthis in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And stop saying you're my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, you are my son, Saji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you trying to stab me then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.94,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's fighting\Nwithout a raid suit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the tea party ends, I'm\Nbooking it back to my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't really marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Still spouting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all about strengthening your forces\Nby forming a bond with Big Mom, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So it shouldn't matter\Nwhere I go afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The issue is not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd stain the Vinsmoke name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom would punish such treasury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be mistaken if you think I give\Na crap what happens to you chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I only came here\Nto save my friends' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You depended your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastards were never my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.32,0:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he was in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.66,0:05:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji was making some\Nof that rat food again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Royalty doesn't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.30,0:05:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You piece of trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever touch me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You were all bored all the same day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we related to such a loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.28,0:06:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Picking on Sanji again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They hurt me, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell them to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.84,0:07:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are not a fighter and you\Nare unable to stand up for yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I gain nothing by raising you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to the family name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,On your feet, I'll toughen you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a disgrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yonji, have at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be fun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Reminiscing on old times, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He blocked the blade with his leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil son I once knew\Nwe'll talk, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetch a sword. Huh? Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you haven't forgotten my teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you knew me at all, you'd\Nrealize I never use that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this through your skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My hands are for cooking only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.44,0:09:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, weak little Sanji's\Nbecome quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For cooking, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still making rat food?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Serving is not a talent befit for royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're out of touch, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why resist the marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what's good for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still in close combat mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how the\Nlegendary Carrot fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to see this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,An aerial attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo-jamba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gol-yay. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.06,0:10:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,War is the catalyst for\Nscientific progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Electromagnetic crux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.62,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Germa you were once familiar\Nwith is now a relic of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Sanji, I got\Nsomething I want to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you owe someone respect just\Nbecause you're elated by blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Any fond memories of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't think of one, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You suffered so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so dark in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Boil up, Freer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've got nothing\Nbut anger towards him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wall up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's heading straight for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,E. M.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chef, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tough as nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe\Nyou're the same Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can save the small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After this damn tea party's over, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be free from Big\NMom's invitation curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd be less of a scumbag,\Nbut it seems you've only gotten worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of this room, geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stranger to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you that's\Nmy blood in your veins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not be mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What you witnessed today, boy?,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,was an example of how loyal\Nthe Germa soldiers truly are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,willing to give their\Nlives at a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Their unwavering devotion is\Nthe backbone of Jerma's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why the hell aren't you using them\Nto chase your stupid, grandiose dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to conquer\Nthe North Blue, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's perfect for an evil army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quick on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By forming an alliance with Big Mom,\Nit will strengthen our forces tenfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And that dream can soon become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can comprehend at least\Nthat much, I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I did not intend to\Nruffle any feathers, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I require Big Mom's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but unfortunately she demands\Na blood connection in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not relish the thought\Nof marrying off one of my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,invaluable sons to someone in\Nthat demented madwoman's lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I remembered, years\Nago, I had another child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was an absolute failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be a sacrifice for\Nthe family, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't changed my opinion of you, and\NI do not think of you as a worthy son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.09,0:16:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You mentioned your hands\Nare important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That works in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You know of the collars the Celestial\NDragons put on their slaves, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If they try to escape from their masters,\Nit detonates, removing their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These are rigged to work the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to flee, your\Nhands will be blown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Screw you! Take them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, Big Mom had the\Nforesight to lend those to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the only one who possesses the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't fuss with them if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the key is the only\Nway to take them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Safely, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:16:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cuffs or no cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have the entire German\Narmy to put you in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.76,0:17:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will see this marriage through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Soto Land News!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.42,0:17:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Boss\NJinbe betrayed Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It says it all happened yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.28,0:17:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Things move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a crying shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he marched on up and stopped\NMama's food tantrum was pretty damn cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.70,0:17:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as I understand it,\Nhe has to leave her crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe he took that back in\Na second soon as he heard the price wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess being the first son of the sea\Nmeans nothing to that traitor, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost respect for that coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What a loser
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,was unaware you were working\Nfor big mom that must
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,be why fish man island\Nwas under her protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So this Jinbe fellow, he was a\Nformer warlord, that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How's someone like him her subordinate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Brook, do you\NKaroo know this man? We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a rather important person to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you haven't changed\Nyour mind and still
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,wish for me to become\Na member of your crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,well, I'll gladly take you up on your\Noffer then, if you see fit to have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose this is what he\Nmeant by having obligations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of business he\Ncould have with Big Mom, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This article still befuddles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't sound like the Jinbe we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he preparing to come see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have somewhere I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mademoiselle Pudding, whatever\Nyour matter of urgency is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it can wait, n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing could be more important\Nthan choosing the correct author!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your opinion on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it would suit you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this one? I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That color will look wonderful on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You could honestly wear any of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do any of these jump out\Nat you, Lady Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you perhaps know which\None the groom would prefer then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only met him once, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.18,0:19:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't she be meeting\Nwith Luffy right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that she can't break away\Nfrom her hand servants at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the others aren't in trouble now\Nthat the plan has gone horribly awry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is how it's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that probably means that Sanji\Ndoesn't even realize we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did Luffy see back at the shore then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.88,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a clue, but we can assume he\Nmistook someone else for Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that egg guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.34,0:20:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I've seen him\Non Big Mom's ship before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know him all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Baron Tamago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago, may I speak with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about the Straw Hat ship that\Nlanded at Chocolatown yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,THEY ALREADY KNOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really rather unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems after they left, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckham's, who escorted the pirates\Nhere, was nowhere to be found, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,THEY KNOW EVERYTHING!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,However, as for the four Straw Hats who\Nwandered into the seducing woods today...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're as good as captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,THEY'RE ALREADY CAUGHT!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But the whereabouts of\Nthe other two are unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How do they have so much dirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They know every intimate detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They had to have been\Nspying on us somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.94,0:21:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an error, it declares\Nthat the mink is a panther.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in fight a jaguar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It s 'appelle Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.04,0:21:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.56,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall just say, we have a past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Minx's next step. I believe I\Nhave an idea of what is up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ce ne Fight Rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your order is to seek\Nout Pec-Holmes! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Pec-Holmes, mon ami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.78,0:21:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you were surprisingly still alive,\NI had hoped to ask Mama to pardon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But your involvement with les parades\Nmakes that très compliqué for moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You are quite the handful, c'est la vie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.30,0:21:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:21:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut your trap, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a good baby and suck it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got him laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's my big shot? You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.62,0:22:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a good little goon you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.88,0:22:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll become a big, strong,\Nwise guy, just like your pops one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this sappy crap. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the real looker, ain't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.98,0:22:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His life is just beginning,\Nand yours is coming to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like one of them\Nhigh-concept artsy paintings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you got no one to\Nblame but yourself, Peckums.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.16,0:23:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose this fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I gave you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.42,0:23:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't seem too charitable\Nif you ask me. Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you what\Nhappened back in Zo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't get your crap in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to break it to you, pal, but you\Nain't cut out for this line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why I brought you here, old boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect place to lose a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got any last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.70,0:24:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're\Ngetting into with mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.46,0:24:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.18,0:25:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,see your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.09,0:25:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're covered in bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.58,0:25:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal, you old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.44,0:25:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've explained this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever use your\Nhands for fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.42,0:25:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.46,0:25:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now I believe that I have\Ngiven you more than ample funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.08,0:25:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree with me, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.48,0:25:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I continued the research\Nthe entire time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.26,0:25:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream's almost reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This pleases me so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.58,0:26:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish for all races around the\Nworld to become one big family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.72,0:26:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And sit around the table at the\Nsame eye level with one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want them all to\Npartake in what I drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And indulge whatever I devour.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.90,0:26:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't a world like that sound divine to\Nyou and that dream will soon come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.44,0:26:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you, Caesar, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.74,0:26:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to make my family\Ngrow to the size of giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With the power of science, your research\Nmust be close to finished by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.08,0:26:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept saying the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.06,0:27:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,project was complete, but you needed a\Nlittle extra money to keep research going.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.82,0:27:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope all that cash I\Nfunneled your way helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.74,0:27:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite eager to know how things went.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.68,0:27:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.20,0:27:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,swimmingly thanks to your generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The gigantification of the human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was doing the experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.54,0:27:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world wants to get\Ntheir hands on that technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.40,0:27:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my testing was only\Ndone on children and the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.80,0:27:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,results were rather grim\Nfrankly i was Confident that
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.90,0:27:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole endeavor was\Nfruitless from the start you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.52,0:27:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,can't turn ordinary people\NGiant with some magic drug like
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,she asked that's why i\Ncheated her out of as much
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.14,0:27:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,money as she Could bleed i
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,splurged every last berry on
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.02,0:27:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,seafaring call girls she doesn't\Neven realize The research
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.46,0:27:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,she was paying for funded\Nmy booze and women binges.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.22,0:27:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were the good old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.04,0:28:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hide behind Joker and\Nget away with whatever I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.90,0:28:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could have guessed he\Nwould ever be defeated, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My fast and loose lifestyle has\Nfinally caught up with me. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.98,0:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought I'd be\Nuntouchable for the rest of my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.42,0:28:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all because of\Nthat miserable pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.20,0:28:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with those faces, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, that's right about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, and I mean\Neverything, fell through on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn Straw Hat Luffy took advantage\Nof the tireless work I was doing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And just as my research was\Napproaching the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He and that dumb Trafalgar\NLaw came and screwed it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.32,0:29:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for those two brats, the\Ngigantism drug would have been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.62,0:29:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just within my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.08,0:29:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sad to report that\Nthe special lab built by
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the world government was\Ntotal thanks to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I could only achieve results in a
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.86,0:29:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,perfectly controlled\Nenvironment like that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The money you invested in that lab\Ncontaining my hard work is all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.04,0:29:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer create\Nthe gigantism drug because
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,those damn pirates\Nruined everything for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A tragedy my hard work destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need another lab\Nlike on Punk Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.06,0:29:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I acquired the blueprint to it ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.18,0:29:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Our minister of candy is quite skilled\Nand can make anything out of sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.27,0:30:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you need and you'll have\Nunlimited funds at your disposal. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.68,0:30:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you being serious right now, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.40,0:30:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I appreciate it. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.50,0:30:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.00,0:30:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When will it be ready? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.88,0:30:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One week?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.50,0:30:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.02,0:30:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.62,0:30:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mankind has been at this for\Ncenturies with no results.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.86,0:30:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How will I talk my way out of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.64,0:30:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.62,0:30:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety-lick, lickety-lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.86,0:30:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the laboratory meet\Nyour standard, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.78,0:30:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a spitting image of\Nyour old one, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Coo-coo-coo-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.50,0:31:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the interior has\Nthe same lickety-layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Coo-coo-coo-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.71,0:31:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.28,0:31:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that ticker can take a licking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.44,0:31:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.62,0:31:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, don't leave yet, Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my heart before\Nyou head out. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.98,0:31:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.38,0:31:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You got two weeks, so you had better\Nproduce the gigantism drug Lickety Split.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.74,0:31:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If it takes any longer than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.42,0:31:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you into a candy man\Nand lick you down to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In just two weeks I'll be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.56,0:32:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's like 12 times now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.30,0:32:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I found more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.42,0:32:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gathered up so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.80,0:32:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Choke! Choke!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.74,0:32:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.24,0:32:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Choke! Choke! Choke!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.08,0:33:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you multiplying? Tell me!
